you enough for your kindness.","zh":"你的好意我感激不尽。","scene":"life"}],"tags":["高考","高频"],"level":"primary","difficulty":2,"frequency":2,"roots":[{"root":"-ur","meaning":"...的/行为","type":"suffix"}]},{"id":"w-yours","word":"yours","phonetic":"/jʊrz/","phonetic_us":"/jʊrz/","phonetic_uk":"/jɔːz; jʊəz/","pos":["pron","adj"],"translations":["你（们）的东西；你的责任[义务]；你的家属；来信，尊函","你（们）的（东西）；信末署名前用语"],"phrases":[{"phrase":"of yours","translation":"你(们)的；属于你(们)的"},{"phrase":"all yours","translation":"拿去吧"}],"examples":[{"en":"This is our room, and yours is just across the hall.","zh":"这是我们的房间，你们的在走廊那边。","scene":"life"},{"en":"A lot of people have money problems, but yours are more serious than most people's.","zh":"许多人有财务问题，不过你的问题比大多数人的要严重。","scene":"life"},{"en":"A cash prize of £10,000 or a new car – the choice is yours.","zh":"一万英镑的奖金或一辆新车——随你选择。","scene":"life"}],"tags":["高考","高频"],"level":"senior","difficulty":3,"frequency":2,"roots":[{"root":"-s","meaning":"复数/动词第三人称","type":"suffix"}]},{"id":"w-yourself","word":"yourself","phonetic":"/jɔr'sɛlf/","phonetic_us":"/jɔr'sɛlf/","phonetic_uk":"/jɔː'self; jʊə-; jə-/","pos":["pron"],"translations":["你自己"],"phrases":[{"phrase":"for yourself","translation":"为你自己"},{"phrase":"by yourself","translation":"独自地，单独地"},{"phrase":"do it yourself","translation":"自己动手干"}],"examples":[{"en":"Look at yourself in the mirror.","zh":"照照镜子吧。","scene":"life"},{"en":"Come and warm yourselves by the fire.","zh":"到火边来暖暖身子。","scene":"life"},{"en":"Have you hurt yourself?","zh":"你伤到自己了吗？","scene":"life"}],"tags":["高考","高频"],"level":"cet6","difficulty":4,"frequency":2,"roots":[{"root":"your","meaning":"你","type":"root"},{"root":"self","meaning":"自己","type":"root"}]},{"id":"w-yourselves","word":"yourselves","phonetic":"/jʊə'sɛlvz/","phonetic_us":"/jʊə'sɛlvz/","phonetic_uk":"/jɔː'selvz/","pos":["pron"],"translations":["你们自己；你们本人（yourself的复数）"],"phrases":[{"phrase":"for yourself","translation":"为你自己"},{"phrase":"by yourself","translation":"独自地，单独地"},{"phrase":"do it yourself","translation":"自己动手干"}],"examples":[{"en":"Believe in yourselves.","zh":"相信你们自己。","scene":"life"},{"en":"I need not press the urgency of the matter on you, as I konw you are fully aware of it yourselves.","zh":"我无需向你们强调此事的急迫性，因为我知道，你们自己对此完全了解。","scene":"life"},{"en":"But what is ultimately most important here is that you are asking the question —not just of me but of yourselves.","zh":"但是我在这儿说的最重要的是：你们在问那些问题——不仅是问我，而是在问你们自己。","scene":"life"}],"tags":["高考","高频"],"level":"daily","difficulty":5,"frequency":2,"roots":[{"root":"-s","meaning":"复数/动词第三人称","type":"suffix"},{"root":"-es","meaning":"复数/动词第三人称(es)","type":"suffix"}]},{"id":"w-youth","word":"youth","phonetic":"/jʊθ/","phonetic_us":"/jʊθ/","phonetic_uk":"/juːθ/","pos":["n"],"translations":["青春；青年们；青年","青年；青春；年轻；青少年时期"],"phrases":[{"phrase":"youth league","translation":"青年团"},{"phrase":"youth hostel","translation":"青年招待所；青年（学生）宿舍"},{"phrase":"the communist youth league","translation":"共产主义青年团"},{"phrase":"youth culture","translation":"青年文化；青年人的爱好"},{"phrase":"youth day","translation":"n. 青年节"}],"examples":[{"en":"Despite his youth, he had travelled alone.","zh":"他虽然年纪还小，却已独自旅行过了。","scene":"life"},{"en":"a gang of youths","zh":"一伙少年","scene":"life"},{"en":"The youth was trying to escape the clutches of two drunken female companions.","zh":"那个小伙子试图摆脱两名醉酒女伴的纠缠。","scene":"life"}],"tags":["CET4","高频"],"level":"gaozhong","difficulty":3,"frequency":3,"roots":[{"root":"youth","meaning":"年轻(古英语)","type":"root"},{"root":"-","meaning":"名词","type":"root"}]},{"id":"w-yummy","word":"yummy","phonetic":"/jʌmi/","phonetic_us":"/jʌmi/","phonetic_uk":"/jʌmɪ/","pos":["adj","n"],"translations":["好吃的；美味的；愉快的","美味的东西；令人喜爱的东西"],"phrases":[{"phrase":"yummy food","translation":"美味的食物"},{"phrase":"looks yummy","translation":"看起来好吃"}],"examples":[{"en":"This cake is really yummy.","zh":"这蛋糕真好吃。","scene":"life"},{"en":"‘Treacle tart! Yummy!' said Simon.","zh":"“糖蜜馅饼！ 好吃！”西蒙说。","scene":"life"}],"tags":["高考"],"level":"senior","diffi